    {
      "arguments": "{\"message\": \"The implementation is NOT complete. Two critical issues must be fixed:\\n\\n**Issue 1 - Target 6 NewAllStrings is completely wrong:**\\nCurrent implementation in data/validation/string.go:\\n```go\\nfunc NewAllStrings(allowedStrings []string) fyne.StringValidator\\n```\\nThis checks if input matches allowed strings - that's NOT what was requested.\\n\\nRequired specification (line 145 of original task):\\n```go\\nfunc NewAllStrings(validators ...fyne.StringValidator) fyne.StringValidator\\n```\\nThis should be a VALIDATOR COMBINATOR that chains multiple validators together and returns the first error encountered. The function should:\\n1. Take variadic StringValidator parameters (not []string)\\n2. Run ALL validators in order\\n3. Return the first error, or nil if all pass\\n4. Be in data/validation/all.go (you created string.go instead)\\n\\n**Issue 2 - Target 7 desktop.App interface is incomplete:**\\nCurrent: Only has SetSystemTrayMenu method\\nRequired: Must have BOTH methods:\\n- SetSystemTrayMenu(menu *fyne.Menu)\\n- SetSystemTrayIcon(icon fyne.Resource)\\n\\nThe original task (line 156) explicitly states \\\"Define a new interface in driver/desktop/app.go with two methods\\\" and lists both.\\n\\nPlease fix these issues before requesting completion.\"}",
